            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Described is a method for use with a subterranean well, the method comprising: conveying a bottom hole assembly into the well, the bottom hole assembly comprising an anchor, a whipstock and a mill; setting the anchor; then applying increased hydraulic pressure to a hydraulic release mechanism of the whipstock; and then applying a force in an uphole direction to the mill, thereby separating a section of the whipstock from a remainder of the whipstock.</p>
